 Team weitere Messungen. Zusammenfassend lässt sich sagen, dass schnelles Handeln nötig ist. Weiterführende Studien sollen diese Hypothese im kommenden Jahr überprüfen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Wissenschaftlicher Artikel über Umweltforschung","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-65-wissenschaftssprache","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, in deinem Absatz steht \"Ich glaube, dass die Methode funktioniert.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_065_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-65-wissenschaftssprache","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"\" Das ist zu persönlich für die Präsentation.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_065_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-65-wissenschaftssprache","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Stimmt.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_065_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-65-wissenschaftssprache","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Wie würdest du das formulieren?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_065_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-65-wissenschaftssprache","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Die Ergebnisse zeigen, dass die Methode unter den gegebenen Bedingungen zuverlässig funktioniert.","speaker":"Frauke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_065_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-65-wissenschaftssprache","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Viel überzeugender.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_065_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b